OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fthis evening with some late sunshine.
OL,7,FGenerally dry overnight with clear
OL,8,Fperiods. A cooler feeling night than
OL,9,Frecently, with winds remaining mainly
OL,10,Flight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FLargely dry with sunny
OL,13,Fspells and patchy cloud. Feeling
OL,14,Ffresher than recent days with a gentle
OL,15,Fnortherly breeze.
